  "body": "**Link to problem area**: See the **Request body example** section of https://spec.matrix.org/v1.2/client-server-api/#post_matrixclientv3search.\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\nThe arrays under search categories -> room_events -> filter -> {not_rooms, not_senders, ...} should be empty, rather than containing a single `null` value. I suspect this is being generated somewhere from the definition laid out by:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/blob/d38663f65dad9814d0d2c2727c22678035010620/data/api/client-server/definitions/event_filter.yaml#L14-L47",
